  "body": "## Summary\n- `develop` was 49 commits behind `main` (VPC networking hardening for the auth Lambda, the full `auth-smoke.yml` deploy+smoke workflow, and the AWS credential model rewrite), while `develop` only had 4 small commits (Sept 2-3) not in `main` — CI/test tweaks that predate and are superseded by `main`'s later rewrite of the same files.\n- This closes the gap by merging `main` into `develop`, taking `main`'s content on every file that differed. After this merge, `develop`'s tree is identical to `main`'s.\n- Supersedes #32, which was stuck in conflict trying to do the same merge.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `npm run lint`\n- [x] `npm run typecheck`\n- [x] `npm test` (33 passed)\n- [x] Diffed the resulting tree against `origin/main` — zero differences",
